<section class="portal-landing">
  <div class="portal-panel">
    <p class="portal-eyebrow">DRIFTER OBSERVATORY / ENTRY SEQUENCE</p>
    <h1>进入深空算法观测站</h1>
    <p class="portal-copy">这里记录算法证明、CTF 复盘、密码学边界与二进制探索。每一篇文章都尽量保留推导、证据、失败样例和可复现路径。</p>
    <div class="portal-actions">
      <a class="portal-action primary" href="<%- url_for('/algorithm/') %>">启动算法星图</a>
      <a class="portal-action" href="<%- url_for('/ctf/') %>">打开 CTF 档案</a>
      <a class="portal-action" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">浏览观测记录</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="portal-radar" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="radar-ring ring-one"></span>
    <span class="radar-ring ring-two"></span>
    <span class="radar-ring ring-three"></span>
    <span class="radar-sweep"></span>
    <span class="radar-core"></span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="guide-grid" aria-label="观测站引导">
  <details class="guide-card">
    <summary>
      <span class="guide-card-index">01</span>
      <span class="guide-card-heading">
        <strong>算法星图</strong>
        <small>图论、动态规划、数论与数据结构的训练坐标。</small>
      </span>
      <span class="guide-card-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
    </summary>
    <div class="guide-card-body">
      <p>从状态定义、边权建模和复杂度上限出发，把算法题拆成可以验证的轨道。</p>
      <a class="guide-card-link" href="<%- url_for('/algorithm/') %>">进入完整引导</a>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="guide-card">
    <summary>
      <span class="guide-card-index">02</span>
      <span class="guide-card-heading">
        <strong>CTF 档案</strong>
        <small>Web、Crypto、Reverse、Pwn 与 Misc 的复盘入口。</small>
      </span>
      <span class="guide-card-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
    </summary>
    <div class="guide-card-body">
      <p>保存漏洞成因、验证证据、利用链和修复思路，不只留下最终 payload。</p>
      <a class="guide-card-link" href="<%- url_for('/ctf/') %>">进入完整引导</a>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="guide-card">
    <summary>
      <span class="guide-card-index">03</span>
      <span class="guide-card-heading">
        <strong>随记</strong>
        <small>工程记录、工具笔记与暂时无法归类的观察。</small>
      </span>
      <span class="guide-card-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
    </summary>
    <div class="guide-card-body">
      <p>把环境配置、博客维护和正在形成的想法放在这里，给知识留下一个安静的位置。</p>
      <a class="guide-card-link" href="<%- url_for('/about/') %>">进入完整引导</a>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

<section class="latest-transmissions">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span>Latest Transmissions</span>
    <h2>最新观测记录</h2>
  </div>
  <%- partial('_partial/archive', {expand: true, index: true}) %>
</section>
